Interactability_Text_Line_2 Plate activity has been detected under the island of Easter Island. Scientists are unsure of what is causing this sudden and extreme activity. All that is known is that there's a good chance that a number of the now-extinct volcanoes on the island may wake up in the coming weeks. If you live near any of the Volcanoes, evacuate while you still can.